|

:INFO
Art. 26 Administrative appeal
Rulings made by the Department under Article 17 paragraph 1 shall be subject to appeal to the Federal Council. …
|

:NOTE
Art. 26 — Amended by No I of the FA of 4 Oct. 1996, in force since 1 Feb. 1997 (AS 1997 114; BBl 1995 III 1).
